            <div class="field field--name-field-in-border-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field--item">Introduction to NUTRAVA® Citrus Fiber </div>
      </div>
    
            <div class="field field--name-field-in-wysiwyg1 field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><p>Explore the possibilities and benefits of the first Upcycled Certified® citrus fiber ingredient on the market. With the continued growth in consumer demand for clean label products, citrus fiber addresses the need for nature based, clean label-friendly, and recognisable ingredients in a variety of food and beverage products. It is made from sustainably sourced citrus peels that come from the juice industry. NUTRAVA® Citrus Fiber offers unique water-binding, texturising, and stabilisation capabilities, and can be used as a substitute for sugar or fat in many recipes. This fiber is a great ingredient for your product development portfolio. (Upcycled Certified® is a registered trademark of <a href="https://www.wherefoodcomesfrom.com/">Where Food Comes From</a>.)&nbsp;</p></div>
      
</div>
</div>
        
                            <div class="field--item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--ingredient-accordion paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--show-border" id="paragraph-39101">
