        <div class="panel-body">
            
            <div class="field field--name-field-in-accordion-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><p>If you are looking to enhance texture, stabilise, suspend, and improve water binding across bakery, beverages, condiments, fruit applications, meat &amp; seafood, and alternative proteins, we have the solution for you.&nbsp;</p></div>
      
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

                  
